---
import { Calendar, ArrowLeft, ChevronDown } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<!-- Events Header / Hero Section -->
<header
  class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-[#000080] overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-16"
>
  <!-- Background Overlay / Image Placeholder consistent with Landing -->
  <!-- Background Overlay / Image Placeholder -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-[#00082d] to-transparent opacity-90 z-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gray-600 mix-blend-multiply z-0">
    <!-- Placeholder for Hero Image -->
    <div
      class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center bg-[url('/bg-hero.jpeg')]"
    ></div>
  </div>

  <div class="z-20 text-center text-white px-4">
    <!-- Breadcrumb / Back Navigation -->
    <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="flex items-center p-4 gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-200 hover:text-[#FCE300] bg-white/10 rounded-full border border-white/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"
      >
        <ArrowLeft class="w-5 h-5" />
        <span>Volver al Inicio</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Tag -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 p-4 rounded-full bg-[#FCE300]/20 border border-[#FCE300]/40 text-[#FCE300] text-sm font-semibold mb-6">
      <Calendar class="w-4 h-4" />
      <span>Vida Escolar & Comunidad</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Title -->
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tight text-white">
      Eventos Institucionales
    </h1>

    <!-- Decorative Accent Line -->
    <div class="w-20 h-1.5 bg-[#FCE300] mx-auto mb-6 rounded-full"></div>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl text-gray-200 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Revive las actividades, proyectos pedagógicos y momentos destacados que enriquecen la formación de nuestros estudiantes en la IER La Aurora.
    </p>

    <!-- Call to actions / Quick jump -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center items-center">
      <a
        href="#felix-y-susana"
        class="bg-[#FCE300] text-[#000080] p-4 rounded-full font-bold text-base md:text-lg shadow-lg hover:bg-white hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 inline-flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        <span>Ver Primer Evento</span>
        <ChevronDown class="w-5 h-5 animate-bounce" />
      </a>
      <a
        href="/#contacto"
        class="border-2 border-white/80 text-white p-4 rounded-full font-bold text-base md:text-lg hover:bg-white hover:text-[#000080] hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        Contacto
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
